SUMMARY:The Moon occults Venus
DESCRIPTION:Venus disappears at 17:17:42 and reappears at 18:29:00 IST\, se
 en from Belgaon.\nThe Moon is 41° up in the SW · daylight\, Sun +18°.\n
 Times against the real lunar limb.\nMap\, timings and the view at the Moon
 's edge: https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?city=Belgaon
URL:https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?city=Belgaon
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
